PLACEHOLDER -- this filename is reserved for the KiCad schematic
(eeschema) source for the LANCET thermal controller. The binary file
will be committed in the v0.1.0 release tagged for Zenodo archiving.

The authoritative net list and component values until then are in
schematic.md (same directory). The reference build is breadboard-only
and is fully documented in breadboard_layout.md.

